  <ModuleMeta><Name>Payments Domain</Name><Description>Payment transaction aggregate with capture/void/refund.</Description><Category>DDD</Category><Stability>Stable</Stability></ModuleMeta>
  <Principles><Principle id="P1" name="Single Responsibility"><Description>Payment aggregate tracks the full transaction lifecycle: initiated → authorized → captured → refunded → voided. Each transition requires gateway interaction via the Infrastructure layer.</Description><Rationale>Aggregate ensures payment invariants (one capture per authorization, refund ≤ captured amount) are enforced.</Rationale></Principle></Principles>
  <Features><Feature id="F1" name="Payments " type="core">Void After Capture: Attempting to void a payment that has already been captured.</Feature></Features>
  <AntiPatterns><AntiPattern id="AP1" name="Void is only valid before capture. After capture, " severity="critical"><Avoid>Proceeding without validation or proper configuration.</Avoid><BetterApproach>Always validate inputs and follow documented patterns.</BetterApproach></AntiPattern></AntiPatterns>
